# Secrets — house rule: nothing of this kind ever reaches GitHub
.env
.env.*
*-sa.json
*.key
*.pem
rclone.conf
credentials/

# OS / editor
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
*.swp
.idea/
.vscode/

# Handoff file generated by the skill when run inside this repo.
# Ignored here only to keep this distribution repo clean and avoid confusion
# with examples/CURRENT.example.md. In your own projects, committing CURRENT.md
# is usually the right call — it is how the next person picks the work up.
#
# Anchored to the repo root on purpose: git ignore matching is case-insensitive
# on macOS (core.ignorecase=true), so an unanchored "CURRENT.md" also swallows
# commands/current.md, which is the whole deliverable.
/CURRENT.md
